Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二二三四
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.31,0:00:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊 没人搭理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.07,0:00:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使出浑身解数的搞笑都没人搭理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都迟到了 还好意思说什么冻死人的冷笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁着身体还没硬 请你赶紧开始做拉伸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,断了的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我给你浇点蛋黄酱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要吵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于预赛的表演 我想提高技巧难度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:13.12,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:17.33,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:22.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:27.13,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:32.97,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.31,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:37.39,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:46.53,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.69,0:01:48.11,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.82,0:01:52.91,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:59.58,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:01.08,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:06.09,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:09.22,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:14.35,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.74,0:01:13.12,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:17.33,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:22.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:27.13,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:32.97,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.31,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:37.39,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:46.53,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.69,0:01:48.11,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:49.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.82,0:01:52.91,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:59.58,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:01.08,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:06.09,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:09.22,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:14.35,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的动作都做不到位 还提高难度？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做高难度的动作能拿高分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可要是失败了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扣分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和花样滑冰一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么与其强行练习高难度动作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒不如完善现在的表演吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 在现在的基础上加难度没法练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意志也是一折就断
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知不知道什么叫祸从口入啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你白痴吗 那叫祸从口出
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我、我就说错了一个字而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,训练已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 家教的工作拖了一会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我教的初中生就快中考了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 中考可不轻松啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿沟当年复读两年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我们年纪大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银铜都是一次过的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正要找你呢 我们刚才在讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要提升难度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练让我们大家决定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那自然应该挑战一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何必这么较劲 轻松地练多好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可大家想通过预赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不是更应该完善现在的表演呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远野 你这是放弃努力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你算老几啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 你俩冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟是讨论 出现不同意见也是正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿睛说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想挑战 但要是大家不愿意的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 要是没有下定决心 只会受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有话说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 卓巳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得阿武说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也只想开开心心地表演
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当初加入啦啦队 也是因为看大家跳得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且提高难度就现实而言很难实现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哥还有金都是三年级
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始找工作了 压力挺大的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪今天请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是练高难度动作 训练量也得增加
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是提升难度是为了突破预赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家统一一下意见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且要打工的人也没法增加训练量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 那就先看看情况再说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最晚年底决定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真要练的话最好新年就开练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:15.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巧克帕 巧克帕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是大家都能像你一样吃个巧克力帕妃就开心该多好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天气氛也很尴尬啊 都怪那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿武 你也不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕心里有火 也还是憋着点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是大家都努力训练的话 气氛也能缓和些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是体育系的人的思路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这关西腔也太别扭了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是陈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是锅岛哥和...金
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两杯黑咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你们开始找工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个金融相关公司的联合说明会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去银行 金想做损害保险方向吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中规中矩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人的未来难以预测
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为男人一生的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想为这样的人生提供支持
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.73,0:06:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好完美的志向
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金 锅岛哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 训练...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教头 今天很抱歉请了假
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.55,0:06:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大赛之前 训练和找工作都会加油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金和锅岛哥都很忙碌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔也不好意思叫他们别请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我今天也不能去训练了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打工吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我得去外婆住的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,付费啦办手续之类的 事情不少
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我也不放心大家...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久 别看下面 把腿伸直
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上半身弯曲的话 会让底座之间距离变大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这祥一来不光不稳定 还会给腰増加负担
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 难怪卓巳说腰痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才请假了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腰之所以受伤是因为腹肌背肌太弱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我弟弟和我一起锻炼肌肉 练得很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就请锅岛哥也顺带管理好弟弟的身体状况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么 我练柔道的时候也常被这么训
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姐老说我力量不够 管理身体他是训练的一部分等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前是练柔道的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑带吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有个姐姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我年上OK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.06,0:08:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光棍们毫无意义的对话还是适可而止 继续训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一今天去打工了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他去外婆的医院了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一的外婆在住院
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次听说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特待生又成绩优秀 除了啦啦队活动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要打工和探望外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他却毫无怨言
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 是哪家医院
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饭田桥和神乐坂之间的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以去探望一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家人非常重要 这也是对人生的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不放心他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我去问问阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴希 我有话对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:09:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要退出BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退出？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来应该对一马说的 可他请假了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 你等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:10.55,左下记,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久：说完了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:12.30,左下记,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久：说完了吗？\N——抱歉还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.47,左下记,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久：说完了吗？\N——抱歉还没有\N——我可能去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:14.97,左下记,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久：说完了吗？\N——抱歉还没有\N——我可能去不了\N佐久：阿一同意我们去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:15.76,左下记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(10,700)}佐久：说完了吗？\N——抱歉还没有\N——我可能去不了\N佐久：阿一同意我们去吗\N——い
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,い?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是「同意」的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:22.69,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(577.143,620)}いい
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴说他去不了 就咱们几个去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你明明很想参加啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:39.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新队员里你应该是最努力的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才会想退出是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一心想认真地拼了命地练 可大家却...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我知道这所大学里有男子啦啦队的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然水平不符合我的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得即便目前水平很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要多练 肯定能变得越来越厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之我退出
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.63,0:10:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史 你明明喜欢却要放弃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问桥本一马的外婆住几号病房？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥本一马
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你说一马啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个懂礼貌的好孩子 经常来探望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 等一下 阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉突然来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是让阿一向你征得同意后才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手机关机了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是给你外婆的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过探望就不必了 也别再来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要退出BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久：阿晴我们惹阿一生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我回来晚了 应该把备用钥匙给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然来找我要说什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了是你和千裕的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久给我发来消息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:57.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我不好 就回了个「い」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:11:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,い?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本想回「还没问」 但没来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:02.45,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(612,620)}いや、まだ
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明大家是因为担心我才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你外婆还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没事 好着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是 我一去她就拉着我聊天不让我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以最近经常往医院跑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要说的不只有这些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史他...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史要退出BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不算突然吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一答应了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史是对我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你劝过他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可还是没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是 那家伙一走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们的气氛也就不会这么尴尬了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.61,0:13:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.69,0:13:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史他每次都是第一个来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次也都是第一个汇报训练情况
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他满心期待BREAKERS的表现啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...尚史他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.25,0:13:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实一直都在陪我训练
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他对你说话那么难听
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是想鼓励我 他只是不会说话罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史说我放弃努力 我觉得他没说错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以训练结束后我一直在一个人加练
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做这个动作的时候把背挺直更好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,况且尚史其实一直关注着大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在BREAKERS里水准最过硬的只有翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一勉强还行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 一郎 弦全靠运动神经好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口的柔韧性不够
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金也缺少柔韧性 但基本功扎实
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银、铜体力和力量不够 但非常专注
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锅岛兄弟的舞非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说自己设有那种律动感所以很想好好请教一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陈没什么问题 佐久间只要敢豁出去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安藤的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,训练态度有问题 但在底座训练时非常认真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然还是挺有责任感的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但一看到那张油腔滑调的脸 就忍不住想说他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 大家明明可以再努力一把
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS明明可以变得更加优秀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史为队伍考虑得很周到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好认真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是很难让人看出他在思考罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:16.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不好相处 却是个热血男儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 我们还没教尚史跳舞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS果然不能没有尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 大家一起把他找回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙现在在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 我今天和他约好了等下要一起训练的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉让你特意赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 之前都说好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天听说了 尚史要退出BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可你还是过来陪我训练
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那先从拉伸开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 等一下 这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经跟阿晴说了要退出
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是说了 但心里还没放弃呢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS需要尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须有一个你这样严格的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也说两句
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯也对 温吞水煮不出好吃的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得西兰花无论是煮是炖还是炒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道都好不了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这只是挑食罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是男人就别挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 开始训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然已经决定提升难度了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都想出风头耍耍帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是 有面试的日子会改成晨练
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来吧 尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我原本想加入阳明大学的SPARKS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是高考落榜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我以为自己参加不了啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因为这个 在听说这所大学有男生组建的啦啦队时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的非常开心 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我和你们一起加练吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 寒假也要训练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说 我申请了年底年初大学的集训宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天 那个 非常感谢BREAKERS一行人乘车
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来我们将穿过首都高速公路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经由东关道前往波崎集训宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么在这两个半小时的旅途中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就请各位欣赏我的美妙歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里美妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不如听乌鸦叫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来唱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 玩国王游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联谊吗这是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如山手线游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我睡会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙儿就和小孩子似的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我想起小学的远足
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 到了以后就得集中训练
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想玩也只有现在了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:18:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你晕车？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐最前排吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醋章鱼 醋章鱼不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么今天开始练习加入了新技巧的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我和教练一起想岀来的秘密武器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密武器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就开始训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:22.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人的低糖汤汁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多快煮好了 配料呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在弄呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的刀工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.23,0:20:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这汤太好喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大哥特制的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钟敲完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚敲完87响
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃完了去初拜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有看日出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 去年也是和阿一一起看的新年日出啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在阿晴家屋顶上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不可思义
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年绝对想不到会在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和大家一起看新年日出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 那就来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:19.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BROCCOLI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新年你这说的啥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是糟蹋了这么美的日出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是为了搞笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.33,0:21:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.83,0:21:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那大家一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BROCCOLI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.13,0:21:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是打破了原来的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好孩子好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下尚史也是名副其实的BREAKERS啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.09,0:22:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表演时间2分30秒 一共只有150秒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.63,0:22:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用这短短的时间让其他队伍闭嘴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.59,0:22:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:21.99,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(609.8,504.714)}{\c&HD59FE5&}羁绊的日出
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:21.99,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(618.257,512.486)}{\c&HE4DB75&}羁绊的日出
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:21.99,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(629,515)}羁绊的日出
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:23.31,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:24.94,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:26.56,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.65,0:22:29.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:34.99,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:38.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:41.70,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:45.00,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.46,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:51.84,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.72,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.14,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.35,0:23:01.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.85,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.73,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:12.94,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:16.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:23.25,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:26.58,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.75,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.13,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.22,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.05,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:42.97,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:47.60,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:34.99,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:38.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:41.70,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:45.00,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:48.46,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:51.84,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:54.72,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.14,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.35,0:23:01.60,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.85,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.73,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:12.94,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:16.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:19.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:23.25,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.33,0:23:26.58,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.75,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.13,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.22,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:40.05,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.40,0:23:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一今天请假吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前所未有的异变 这果然是爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.24,0:23:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.61,0:23:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定不太顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失恋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未必就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 太阳之泪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.17,0:24:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Comment: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
